From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 02:48:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 16/16] wasm: add bounded object and field optimizations

Extend Static Hermes with guarded record facts, bounded helper and callback exposure, invocation-scoped normalization reuse, native integer temporaries, async frame lowering, and fresh-object spread/layout fast paths. Keep every transformation opt-in with generic fallbacks, explicit prototype/accessor/GC/exception guards, and semantic fixtures. Add the native value/layout API required by the compiler bridge.
